<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Nset (254)</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>nset &lt;unit&gt; &lt;field&gt; &lt;arguments&gt;
nset &lt;unit&gt;                        (shows the fields)
</pre>
<p>The DIL version of <a cmd='#'>Wizhelp Set</a>, kept in the set zone: it changes a 
field of a unit, as set does. The unit is room (the room you are in), 
self, or someone or something here. Give no field, or a wrong one, and 
the fields you can set are listed.
</p><p>Some fields need a higher level to change on other players, or on 
yourself. Money can't be changed with it. It is logged.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Wizhelp Set</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Wizhelp Wstat</a>
</pre>




</div>